'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 12''' was the twelfth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 27, 2026 at the Tosa Municipal Gymnasium in [[Tosa]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 6 matches.

The night is remembered for the family war ? [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]], the Strong Openweight Champion, handing [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] his first G1 loss in two years ? and for the block's middle collapsing into a knot of 6-point chasers behind him.

